& \"$JOLT_HOME/bin/jolt\" -Srepro -M:jolt:jolt-test src/dev/jolt_test_runner.clj yang.clojure-float-kind-test yang.php.antlr.float-address-test yin.vm.float-test yin.vm.data-test` + `corpus-cross-host-reference-test` | `yang.clojure-float-kind-test`: **21 tests, 55/55 assertions pass (0 fail, 0 error)**; `yang.php.antlr.float-address-test`: **45/45 pass**; `yin.vm.float-test`: **108/108 pass**; `corpus-cross-host-reference-test`: **0 fail, 0 error** (`yin.vm.data-test`: 527/530 pass; 3 errors are pre-existing Chez Scheme `:jolt/unimplemented dao.host.text/units->string` unpaired-surrogate limitation) | `collab/yang-clojure/1795702210000-floatkind-evidence/green-jolt-gates.log` |\n151\t| **`clj-kondo` Lint** | `clojure -M:kondo --lint <all 17 touched/created src & test files>` | **0 errors** (6 pre-existing/minor warnings) | `collab/yang-clojure/1795702210000-floatkind-evidence/kondo.log` |\n152\t\n153\t### 7.3 Per-Gate Checklist (RULING 5)\n154\t\n155\t- **Gate 1 (Real Source Strings)**: `gate1-float-tokens-are-float64-content`, `gate1-integer-tokens-stay-exact-integers`, `gate1-unsupported-categories-not-relabeled`, `gate1-cross-host-canonical-identity` — **GREEN on JVM & Node**.\n156\t- **Gate 2 (Structural & Lexical Preservation)**: `gate2-floats-preserve-through-structure`, `gate2-lexical-contexts-are-not-floats`, `gate2-equal-valued-occurrences-not-coalesced`, `gate2-float-key-policy-parity`, `gate2-macro-generated-numeric-data` — **GREEN on JVM & Node**.\n157\t- **Gate 3 (Collection-Order & Provenance Cross-Host Identity)**: `corpus-cross-host-reference-test` (19 cases including `:integral-floats`) — **GREEN on JVM, Node, & Jolt**; `unmodified-source-integral-floats-test` — **GREEN on JVM & Node**.\n158\t- **Gate 4 (Runtime Semantics Oracle Independent of Digests)**: `gate4-data-oracle`, `gate4-library-inc-dec-float-behavior`, `gate4-repl-arithmetic-reboxed`, `gate4-repl-literal-kind-through-the-catalog`, `gate4-unboxed-control-distinguishes`, `gate4-linked-li