rce-text` vs `:forms-only` boundaries and carrier admission.\n- `test/yang/clojure_collection_order_test.cljc`: `:floats` comment referencing the archived r3 divergence log and ruling `1795693415000`, paired with `:integral-floats` and `unmodified-source-integral-floats-test`.\n","numLines":196,"startLine":1,"totalLines":196}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"call_00_M93zM8ly3IV5ZO2UulvS2184","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
